{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage over 20 resources gathered from your towns spread across an endless, randomly generated map;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of our past, and prepare for what may come...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage - plan your settlements, build as many as you want and optimize your resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026060/extras/0fa386567a9c63fea53f151de8215ae2.poster.avif?t=1774718946\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026060/extras/0fa386567a9c63fea53f151de8215ae2.webm?t=1774718946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026060/extras/0fa386567a9c63fea53f151de8215ae2.mp4?t=1774718946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tile matters - locate your mines and farms wisely to fully exploit the land\u2019s potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026060/extras/a651731969562c398619c6daa2105732.poster.avif?t=1774718946\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026060/extras/a651731969562c398619c6daa2105732.webm?t=1774718946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026060/extras/a651731969562c398619c6daa2105732.mp4?t=1774718946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless world - freely explore and expand without limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >